## Final remarks {#sec-adv-final}

Thanks for making it this far! I hope you give Quarto a go. I'm very happy to offer help and advice if you do decide to do so. In addition, Ferran Brosa Planella is also actively using Quarto for notes, so he has said you can ask him for advice too, and please spread the word! 

Some additional things that I didn't have time to talk about include:

- For some of my notes, I have set up some automated scripting to render standalone tikz diagrams to both SVG and PDF format for embedding respectively into HTML and PDF notes. If this is something that interests you, I can share my workflow.
- Quarto doesn't just produce books, you can also use it to produce presentations and websites. These are all explained in the documentation!
